				<wikidot:authorName>Maxisonfire</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2776379</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>No vote from me.</p> <p>I know that not everything needs an discovery story or motive, but things don't really affect me without having any 'meaning' behind them, even if it is only vaguely implied. A pair of puppets, even if they do mind-control people and kill them, is still kind of boring without any kind of background. So -1 for the SCP.</p> <p>+1 for the incident log though. It puts some character into the situation and the grisly detail makes it seem more real.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
